      "tokens": 414,
      "text": "Here is the CI/CD audit report:\n\n**Workflow files** (6 in `.github/workflows/`):\n\n1. **ci.yml** -- Main pipeline (push/PR). Jobs: lint+build, static analysis (knip, `npm audit`, schema drift, generated-types freshness), unit tests (Node 18/20/22), coverage, BDD tests (35 domain suites), contract tests, fuzz tests, full test suite, API surface check, mutation testing, schemathesis API fuzzing, documentation. Quality gate aggregates results.\n2. **codeql.yml** -- GitHub CodeQL SAST on push/PR/weekly schedule.\n3. **maintenance.yml** -- Weekly (Monday cron + manual). Dependency outdated check, security audit, code quality, health check, ESI spec drift detection (oasdiff).\n4. **pr-validation.yml** -- PR-specific: lint/format/build, static analysis, unit/BDD/integration tests, coverage with PR comment.\n5. **release-please.yml** -- Automated release PR creation via release-please.\n6. **release.yml** -- On tag/release: validates, publishes to npm + GitHub Packages, deploys docs to GitHub Pages, creates release assets.\n\n**What runs in CI**: unit, BDD, integration, contract, fuzz (fast-check), schemathesis (Docker), mutation (Stryker), coverage, ESLint, Prettier, knip, `npm audit`, CodeQL SAST, schema drift, API surface check, generated-types freshness.\n\n**Dependency management**: Dependabot configured (weekly, npm + GitHub Actions, grouped updates).\n\n**What is missing/weak**:\n- Mutation testing and schemathesis both use `continue-on-error: true` -- failures are non-blocking.\n- No Snyk or third-party SCA beyond `npm audit`.\n- No smoke/canary/deployment verification tests post-release.\n- No license compliance scanning.\n- API surface check is also `continue-on-error: true` (non-blocking).",
      "source_message_uuid": "80cc8613-9d0e-4f08-8c3e-a13881716354",
